@page "/components/card"

<PageTitle>Card — Unpoly.Blazor.Shadcn</PageTitle>

<h1 class="doc-h1">Card</h1>
<p class="doc-lede">
    Seven parts. <code>CardAction</code> is placed by a grid rather than floated, which is what
    keeps a long title from running underneath it.
</p>

<h2 class="doc-h2">Basic</h2>
<Example Source="CardBasic.razor"><CardBasic /></Example>

<h2 class="doc-h2">Size</h2>
<p class="doc-note">
    There is no size variant. A card is as wide as you make it and as tall as its content; what
    changes with size is the padding and the type, and both are classes.
</p>
<Example Source="CardSize.razor"><CardSize /></Example>

<h2 class="doc-h2">Spacing</h2>
<Example Source="CardSpacing.razor"><CardSpacing /></Example>

<h2 class="doc-h2">Edge to Edge</h2>
<p class="doc-note">
    <code>--card-spacing</code> is the padding the card applies, so pulling a child out by
    exactly that much lands it flush with the card's own edge. One number, used twice.
</p>
<Example Source="CardEdgeToEdge.razor"><CardEdgeToEdge /></Example>

<h2 class="doc-h2">Image</h2>
<Example Source="CardImage.razor"><CardImage /></Example>

<h2 class="doc-h2">RTL</h2>
<p class="doc-note">
    <code>CardAction</code> moves to the other end without being told: it is placed in the last
    grid column, and grid columns follow the writing direction.
</p>
<Example Source="CardRtl.razor"><CardRtl /></Example>
